there's a kernel of truth to this but for now ... well ... it just ain't
so. there isn't really a set of "other gods". if you're chaotic, Arioch
may reward your service (independent of character type) and if you're
not chaotic then Elbereth may reward you. the corresponding blades are
Stormbringer and Excalibur. obviously, this is slightly askew and it
wouldn't be unreasonable to suspect that the gods have plans to alter
this situation.

named weapons, in addition to being better fighting weapons sometimes
have magic attributes which you can exploit advantageously in certain
circumstances. to me, the best weapon is Mjollnir, it feels right.
however, the other named weapons are not to be slighted since it is
clearly advantageous to have them as opposed to unnamed weapons.

